{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145210/extras/1301f0d00b9c54983f9bfd739b63c131.avif?t=1770476537\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145210/extras_big/1301f0d00b9c54983f9bfd739b63c131.webp?t=1770476537 width=1560 height=159 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynasthir is a dark ages inspired 3rd-person A-RPG, with an obscure world and deadly kinetic combat fueled by adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In its dying breath, Dynasthir beckons. Bestowed upon you is a vast obscure world inviting methodical exploration, skillful combat &amp; profound moments of awe. Push into the unknown &amp; maybe you'll live to tell your tale.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Vibe </strong><br> <br>It is a no handholding, figure it out yourself type experience that harkens back to old days. We put our trust in your playful sense of mind to approach with curiosity; a world which craves it.<strong> </strong><br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action combat, rewarding <strong>skillful planning</strong> &amp; <strong>confidence</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145210/extras/36fd1417a9772f174ab53e582555cbf1.poster.avif?t=1770476537\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145210/extras/36fd1417a9772f174ab53e582555cbf1.webm?t=1770476537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145210/extras/36fd1417a9772f174ab53e582555cbf1.mp4?t=1770476537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_parag